    <parallel-group>UAT12</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Owns `outlook/commands/**`, `shared/commands/**`, `word/commands/**` (shared-controller move only), `shared/taskpane/services/quickSaveHelpers.ts`, the commands/notify entries of `webpack.config.js` and their tests. Do not edit SaveFlow/SaveView/App/useSaveFlow/communicationLookupService/Find components, `src/server/**`, ci-gated-suites.txt, TASK-INDEX or current-task.</parallel-reason>
